Hi all,

For your information, a new version of this draft (-01) has been =
updated, including the following updates:

1. Updated the =E2=80=98IANA Considerations=E2=80=99 section with real =
code points and other fixes according to IANA experts=E2=80=99 =
suggestions.
2. Updated several Chinese standard references to official English =
versions.
3. Addressed other comments on the draft since -00 has been published, =
including typo fixes or so.

Regards,

Paul Yang

> Begin forwarded message:
>=20
> From: internet-drafts@ietf.org
> Subject: New Version Notification for =
draft-yang-tls-tls13-sm-suites-01.txt
> Date: September 19, 2019 at 10:28:41 AM GMT+8
> To: "Paul Yang" <kaishen.yy@antfin.com>
>=20
>=20
> A new version of I-D, draft-yang-tls-tls13-sm-suites-01.txt
> has been successfully submitted by Paul Yang and posted to the
> IETF repository.
>=20
> Name:		draft-yang-tls-tls13-sm-suites
> Revision:	01
> Title:		SM Cipher Suites for Transport Layer Security =
(TLS) Protocol Version 1.3
> Document date:	2019-09-19
> Group:		Individual Submission
> Pages:		12
> URL:            =
https://www.ietf.org/internet-drafts/draft-yang-tls-tls13-sm-suites-01.txt=

> Status:         =
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-yang-tls-tls13-sm-suites/
> Htmlized:       =
https://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-yang-tls-tls13-sm-suites-01
> Htmlized:       =
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/draft-yang-tls-tls13-sm-suites
> Diff:           =
https://www.ietf.org/rfcdiff?url2=3Ddraft-yang-tls-tls13-sm-suites-01
>=20
> Abstract:
>   This draft specifies a set of cipher suites for the Transport Layer
>   Security (TLS) protocol version 1.3 to support SM cryptographic
>   algorithms.
>=20
>=20
>=20
>=20
> Please note that it may take a couple of minutes from the time of =
submission
> until the htmlized version and diff are available at tools.ietf.org.
>=20
> The IETF Secretariat




